# SLGR: SUBTRACT LOGICAL (64). R1 = R1 - R2 (unsigned). CC via cc_sublog64.
:SLGR "SLGR " RRE_R1 "," RRE_R2 is RRE_OP=0xB90B & RRE_R1 & RRE_R2
