# ===========================================================================
# RIa format (A5): IIHH/NILH/NILL/OILL (OPCDs verified: PoP INSERT/AND/OR
# IMMEDIATE sections). RIa_I2 is a signed 16-bit field; mask to raw bits.
# NILH/NILL/OILF CC is set from ONLY the 16 bits ANDed/ORed (PoP notes).
# RILa format (C0): IIHF/IILF/NIHF/OILF. CC unchanged for INSERT IMMEDIATE
# (absent from PoP Appendix C); AND/OR IMMEDIATE CC from the 32 replaced bits.
